            "value": "item 16: Decision Logic"
          },
          "kind": "concept",
          "mark": "paraphrase",
          "original_speaker": null,
          "excerpt": null,
          "paraphrase": "The Family vs. Politics Fork: \"Family comes first\", demonstrated by staying in Hawaii with sick Malia rather than voting on the crime bill.",
          "claim_ids": [],
          "seat_id": "michelle-obama"
        },
        {
          "evidence_id": "ev-michelle-obama-becoming-c017",
          "source_id": "src-michelle-obama-becoming",
          "source_version": "e264bffae8e88954fb6adc830caa8526a72a910e6b18570684d5a758d6d2a3dc",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "section",
            "value": "item 17: Self-Review Protocol"
          },
          "kind": "concept",
          "mark": "paraphrase",
          "original_speaker": null,
          "excerpt": null,
          "paraphrase": "The Video Review: Watching footage of herself with David Axelrod to analyze \"body language, specifically my facial expressions\" and realizing \"it was too serious, too severe.",
          "claim_ids": [],
          "seat_id": "michelle-obama"
        },
        {
          "evidence_id": "ev-michelle-obama-becoming-c018",
          "source_id": "src-michelle-obama-becoming",
          "source_version": "e264bffae8e88954fb6adc830caa8526a72a910e6b18570684d5a758d6d2a3dc",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "section",
            "value": "item 18: Definition of Done"
          },
          "kind": "concept",
          "mark": "paraphrase",
          "original_speaker": null,
          "excerpt": null,
          "paraphrase": "Work is complete when: - Institutional Memory Exists: \"We'd managed two terms in office without a major scandal\" and created briefing books for successors.",
          "claim_ids": [],
          "seat_id": "michelle-obama"
        },
        {
          "evidence_id": "ev-michelle-obama-becoming-c019",
          "source_id": "src-michelle-obama-becoming",
          "source_version": "e264bffae8e88954fb6adc830caa8526a72a910e6b18570684d5a758d6d2a3dc",
          "locator": {
