          "locator": {
            "kind": "section",
            "value": "item 1: Author Background and Authority"
          },
          "kind": "concept",
          "mark": "paraphrase",
          "original_speaker": null,
          "excerpt": null,
          "paraphrase": "Michelle Obama served as First Lady of the United States from 2009 to 2017. She is a graduate of Princeton University and Harvard Law School, and began her career as an attorney at the Chicago law firm Sidley & Austin.",
          "claim_ids": [],
          "seat_id": "michelle-obama"
        },
        {
          "evidence_id": "ev-michelle-obama-the-light-we-carry-c002",
          "source_id": "src-michelle-obama-the-light-we-carry",
          "source_version": "63e3cb8ee3ca81b99359e297876c52139d3eaa82f547fbfc598cf198459467b0",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "section",
            "value": "item 2: The Central Problem"
          },
          "kind": "concept",
          "mark": "paraphrase",
          "original_speaker": null,
          "excerpt": null,
          "paraphrase": "The book addresses the problem of navigating uncertainty, flux, and fear while maintaining one's integrity and light. Specifically, she wrote this for people experiencing periods of major transition or \"deep flux\", whether marked by graduation, divorce, career change, medical diagnosis, or global crises like the pandemic.",
          "claim_ids": [],
          "seat_id": "michelle-obama"
        },
        {
          "evidence_id": "ev-michelle-obama-the-light-we-carry-c003",
          "source_id": "src-michelle-obama-the-light-we-carry",
          "source_version": "63e3cb8ee3ca81b99359e297876c52139d3eaa82f547fbfc598cf198459467b0",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "section",
            "value": "item 3: The Root Cause of Human Struggle"
          },
          "kind": "concept",
          "mark": "paraphrase",
          "original_speaker": null,
          "excerpt": null,
          "paraphrase": "The root cause is not the external obstacles themselves, but the internalization of fear and the narratives of \"not-mattering\" that become attached to our differentness.",
          "claim_ids": [],
          "seat_id": "michelle-obama"
        },
        {
          "evidence_id": "ev-michelle-obama-the-light-we-carry-c004",
          "source_id": "src-michelle-obama-the-light-we-carry",
          "source_version": "63e3cb8ee3ca81b99359e297876c52139d3eaa82f547fbfc598cf198459467b0",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "section",
            "value": "item 4: The Complete Methodology - Every Step"
          },
          "kind": "concept",
          "mark": "paraphrase",
          "original_speaker": null,
          "excerpt": null,
          "paraphrase": "The methodology is presented as a personal toolbox rather than a rigid formula, organized into ten interconnected practices: Step 1: The Power of Small.",
          "claim_ids": [],
          "seat_id": "michelle-obama"
        },
        {
          "evidence_id": "ev-michelle-obama-the-light-we-carry-c005",
          "source_id": "src-michelle-obama-the-light-we-carry",
          "source_version": "63e3cb8ee3ca81b99359e297876c52139d3eaa82f547fbfc598cf198459467b0",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "section",
            "value": "item 5: Non-Negotiable Principles"
          },
          "kind": "concept",
          "mark": "paraphrase",
          "original_speaker": null,
          "excerpt": null,
          "paraphrase": "- \"When they go low, we go high.\" This is described as a boundary and a test, not just a feeling but a daily practice. - \"Operating with integrity matters.",
          "claim_ids": [],
          "seat_id": "michelle-obama"
        },
        {
          "evidence_id": "ev-michelle-obama-the-light-we-carry-c006",
          "source_id": "src-michelle-obama-the-light-we-carry",
          "source_version": "63e3cb8ee3ca81b99359e297876c52139d3eaa82f547fbfc598cf198459467b0",
          "locator": {
            "kind": "section",
            "value": "item 6: The Transformation Arc"
          },
          "kind": "concept",
          "mark": "paraphrase",
          "original_speaker": null,
          "excerpt": null,
          "paraphrase": "Before: The person is \"wobbly and unsettled,\" paralyzed by \"not-enoughness,\" carrying the label \"I stand out and I don't matter,\" operating with a \"fearful mind\" that rehearses catastrophe, wearing armor that is either too heavy (alienating self) or insufficient (leaving them exposed), feeling isolated, and reacting impulsively to provocation.",
          "claim_ids": [],
          "seat_id": "michelle-obama"
        },
        {
          "evidence_id": "ev-michelle-obama-the-light-we-carry-c007",
          "source_id": "src-michelle-obama-the-light-we-carry",
